Alias   Xibsd_SIGNAL   Xi_b-
Alias   Xibsdbar_SIGNAL    anti-Xi_b+
ChargeConj    Xibsd_SIGNAL   Xibsdbar_SIGNAL
#
Decay Xibsd_SIGNAL
# full list of decays copied from Xi_b- (PDG 5132) block in DECAY.DEC
#                  SemiLeptonic Decays
